<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Data preprocessing.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Feature-wise standardization statistics are computed exclusively from the
normal training split and subsequently applied without modification to the
validation and test splits. Each multivariate time series is segmented into
input windows of length <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L=128" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L=128</annotation></semantics></math>. Each window is divided into
<math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P=8</annotation></semantics></math> non-overlapping temporal patches of length <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell=16" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell=16</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T4" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Common model and optimization settings used across all datasets.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="A2.T4.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T4.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Hyperparameter</th>
<th id="A2.T4.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Value</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T4.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Input window length <math id="A2.T4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">128</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Patch length <math id="A2.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">16</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Number of patches <math id="A2.T4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>P</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">8</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Hidden dimension <math id="A2.T4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">768</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Time-series encoder layers</td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">3</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Cross-modal fusion layers</td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">2</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">Attention heads</td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">8</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
