<tr id="A2.T4.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;"><math id="A2.T4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\mathrm{full}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>full</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\mathrm{full}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T4.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">0.5</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A2.T4.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><span id="A2.T4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;"><sup id="A2.T4.3.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="A2.T4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup> PSM uses an initial learning rate of <math id="A2.T4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p></div></div>
</figure>
