<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>
Dataset-wise comparison between random semantic-free and
dataset-agnostic semantic normality references.
Results are reported as mean <math id="A3.T10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> sample standard deviation over five
random seeds.
The best result in each dataset–metric column is shown in <span id="A3.T10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>;
values tied at the displayed precision are both highlighted.
</figcaption>
